arr[query(0, 0, n - 1, 2, 6, 3)+1]);


Output: 3rd smallest element in range 3 to 7 is: 5 

Time complexity: To build segment tree: O(n*log(n)) For each query : O(log(n)*log(n))



Auxiliary Space: O(n+N) where N=1e5
